-- Canonical d525 and native 3816 global permission bodies differ only in two comments.
-- All five target bodies, unknown-state refusals and original attribute gates retained.
-- Full pg_proc metadata is additionally preserved except intended prosrc/provolatile.
-- This artifact is neither native migration registration nor a source-history rewrite.
