-- Integrates the exact qualified Admin30985a79 permission-query correction
-- (migration SHA2567df4dc9d9f3023ba9a05f9066837a4bfd8bfe058d4dc58fc74a0d839c14b40a5)
-- without editing or replaying another owner's published migration history.
-- Preserves explicit platform authority, adding server-derived active catalog
-- and current global/selected-company DENY fields for Node API requirements.
-- Global permission union scopes DENY to each grant's own company; a foreign
-- company DENY cannot revoke another company's grant for shared data.
-- Scoped/raw helpers retain original grant branches, valid service actor IDs
-- (no auth.uid equality restriction), current canonical Auth/profile policy,
-- and paused/history semantics (no operational-company requirement).
-- Dynamic clock-dependent functions become VOLATILE; every other identity,
